;“‚…‹ˆ—…ˆ…
		ADD A,C;“‚…‹ˆ—ˆ‚€…Œ € 1
		JR C,STTMBR1;Œ€Š‘ˆŒ“Œ!
		JR STMB02
;“Œ…œ˜…ˆ…
STMB01		SUB C;“Œ…œ˜€…Œ € 1
		JR C,STTMBR1;ŒˆˆŒ“Œ!
STMB02		ADD A,L
		LD E,A;‚…“‹ˆ ˆ’› 3-0
STTMBR1		BIT 2,B;Š“’ˆŒ UTREBLE?
		JR Z,STTMBR2
;Œ…Ÿ…Œ “Ž‚…œ TREBLE, ˆ’› 7-4
		LD A,D
