STMB04		ADD A,L
		LD D,A;‚…“‹ˆ ˆ’› 3-0
STTMBR2		BIT 4,B;Š“’ˆŒ FBASS?
		JR Z,STTMBR3
;ˆ‡Œ……ˆ… —€‘’Ž’› BASS, ˆ’› 3-0
		LD A,E
		AND 0XF0
		LD L,A;‘Ž•€Ÿ…Œ ˆ’› 7-4
