		LD E,A;‚…“‹ˆ ˆ’› 7-4
STTMBR3		BIT 0,B;Š“’ˆŒ FTREBLE?
		JR Z,WRTMBR
;ˆ‡Œ……ˆ… —€‘’Ž’› TREBLE, ˆ’› 3-0
